<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="OISMS gen_models.py" version="24.7.17"><diagram id="dd-00" name="DD-00 Quy ước vật lý"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2339" pageHeight="1654" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="h-1" value="&lt;b&gt;OISMS – Data Design: quy ước vật lý&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;(PostgreSQL 16 · 48 bảng)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="30" width="1200" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n-2" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Cô lập tenant (NFR-TENANT-01)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 47/48 bảng có cột &lt;i&gt;tenant_id uuid NOT NULL&lt;/i&gt; + FK → tenants(id) ON DELETE RESTRICT; riêng &lt;i&gt;tenants&lt;/i&gt; là gốc.&lt;br&gt;• Mỗi bảng có UNIQUE (tenant_id, id); mọi FK nghiệp vụ là khóa kép (tenant_id, x_id) → (tenant_id, id), nên DB chặn tham chiếu chéo tenant.&lt;br&gt;• EF Core: AppDbContext có 46 global query filter &lt;i&gt;TenantId == CurrentTenantService.TenantId&lt;/i&gt; (trả rỗng khi chưa có JWT). Không có filter: tenants (gốc), replenishment_suggestions (chưa có entity).&lt;br&gt;• SaveChanges gọi EnforceTenantGuardsAndAudit(): ném SecurityException nếu đổi TenantId. IgnoreQueryFilters/OpenPrivilegedScope chỉ cho đăng ký, đăng nhập, webhook, job Hangfire.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Index (NFR-TENANT-02)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 40 index tạo bằng CREATE [UNIQUE] INDEX; 39 index bắt đầu bằng tenant_id, ngoại lệ: ix_reservations_expiry (job hết hạn giữ chỗ quét chéo tenant). Một số là partial (WHERE ...).&lt;br&gt;• inventory_transactions: (tenant_id, created_at, id), (tenant_id, sku_id), (tenant_id, branch_id, sku_id, created_at, id); orders: (tenant_id, created_at), (tenant_id, branch_id, created_at, id), (tenant_id, status, created_at, id). Danh sách đủ theo bảng ở hộp ghi chú từng trang.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Toàn vẹn bằng trigger&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 33 trigger. Chặn sửa/xóa (append-only): inventory_transactions, price_change_request_items, sales_invoices, sku_unit_factor_history, stock_count_approvals.&lt;br&gt;• ledger_append_only trên inventory_transactions: BEFORE UPDATE/DELETE/TRUNCATE → oisms_deny_mutation(); sai thì ghi bút toán bù.&lt;br&gt;• stock_lock + stock_consistency (DEFERRABLE) trên inventory_balances, warehouse_inventory_balances, reservations, inventory_transactions: khóa theo (tenant, branch, sku); lúc commit oisms_check_stock() kiểm tồn chi nhánh = tổng tồn các kho, on_hand kho = tổng sổ cái, reserved kho = tổng giữ chỗ Active.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. CHECK&lt;/b&gt;: 151 ràng buộc (trạng thái, số lượng ≥ 0, chuẩn hóa email/SĐT...). Tên và biểu thức rút gọn ở từng trang.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. Quyền&lt;/b&gt;: backend đăng nhập bằng &lt;i&gt;oisms_app&lt;/i&gt; (thành viên role nhóm &lt;i&gt;oisms_runtime&lt;/i&gt;), không phải owner. Quyền theo bảng (S=SELECT, I=INSERT, U=UPDATE, D=DELETE):&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;SIUD&lt;/b&gt;: tenants, users, refresh_tokens, branches, warehouses, categories, brands, units, products, skus, sku_units, suppliers, purchase_order_items, goods_receipts, goods_receipt_items, inventory_balances, warehouse_inventory_balances, stock_transfers, stock_transfer_items, stock_counts, stock_count_items, inventory_adjustments, inventory_adjustment_items, orders, order_items, reservations, payments, payment_accounts, sales_returns, sales_return_items, inventory_transactions, daily_sales_summaries, replenishment_suggestions, shop_integrations, supplier_invoice_items, user_branches&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;SIU&lt;/b&gt;: price_lists, price_change_requests, sku_unit_prices, purchase_orders, stock_count_schedules, stock_count_periods, supplier_invoices, purchase_variances&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;SI&lt;/b&gt;: sku_unit_factor_history, price_change_request_items, sales_invoices, stock_count_approvals&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6. Kiểu dữ liệu&lt;/b&gt;: khóa uuid (gen_random_uuid()); số lượng numeric(18,3) theo đơn vị gốc; tiền numeric(20,2); giá vốn numeric(20,6); thời điểm timestamptz; thuộc tính linh hoạt jsonb.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7. Thay đổi schema&lt;/b&gt;: không dùng EF migrations. Mỗi thay đổi = file mới trong docker/postgres/migrations/ + cập nhật oisms_schema.sql + RequiredTables + init-oisms.sh.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nguồn: docs/database/oisms_schema.sql, AppDbContext.cs. Sinh tự động bằng gen_models.py." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=6;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="1400" height="703" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="dd-01" name="DD-01 Tenant – tài khoản – chi nhánh"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2339" pageHeight="1654" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="h-56" value="&lt;b&gt;01. Tenant – tài khoản – chi nhánh&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;(Data Design · 6 bảng)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="30" width="1200" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t-1" value="users" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=28;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#000000;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="120" width="270" height="228" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r-2" value="&lt;u&gt;PK&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;id&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&am